cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in published research, please cite it as below."
title: "MPC Designations: Polyglot converter for Minor Planet Center packed and unpacked designations"
abstract: >-
  A reference-corpus library, implemented identically in 25 programming
  languages, for converting between the packed and unpacked designation
  formats used by the IAU Minor Planet Center for asteroids, comets, and
  natural satellites. Each implementation passes the same 2,022,404-entry
  test corpus and the same 94-case error-handling suite.
type: software
authors:
